ripts/2021/11/04/kontoor-brands-inc-ktb-q3-2021-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"KTB 2021 Q3","e":"ktb","d":"2021-11-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Scott Baxter","x":"This was evident in our third quarter results, and it's even more evident in the confidence we have in raising our guidance for fiscal '21 and the momentum we see in the holiday and fiscal '22.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/04/kontoor-brands-inc-ktb-q3-2021-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"KTB 2021 Q3","e":"ktb","d":"2021-11-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Rustin Welton","x":"And as you can see, we remain well on track with our raised full year guide.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/04/kontoor-brands-inc-ktb-q3-2021-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"KTB 2025 Q3","e":"ktb","d":"2025-11-03","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Scott H. Baxter","x":"To support this momentum, we will continue to invest behind our demand creation platforms, including live sports, streaming, and social media.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/03/kontoor-brands-ktb-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"KTB 2025 Q3","e":"ktb","d":"2025-11-03","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Joseph A. Alkire","x":"Adjusted SG&A expense is expected to increase approximately 24%, reflecting the contribution from Helly Hansen as well as increased investments primarily in the areas of demand creation, technology, and direct-to-consumer.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/03/kontoor-brands-ktb-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"KTB 2025 Q3","e":"ktb","d":"2025-11-03","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Joseph A. Alkire","x":"In the U.S., revenue increased 1%, driven by 11% growth in DTC.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/03/kontoor-brands-ktb-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"KTB 2025 Q3","e":"ktb","d":"2025-11-03","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Joseph A. Alkire","x":"These synergies will help fund investments in the business, including geographic and category expansion, demand creation, DTC, supply chain capabilities, and our technology platform.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/03/kontoor-brands-ktb-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"KTB 2025 Q3","e":"ktb","d":"2025-11-03","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Joseph A. Alkire","x":"This was partially offset by increased product costs and the impact from recently enacted increases in tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/03/kontoor-brands-ktb-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"KTB 2025 Q3","e":"ktb","d":"2025-11-03","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Joseph A. Alkire","x":"Excluding Helly Hansen, inventory increased 21% to $560 million, driven by a temporary increase in inventory to support our supply chain transformation, earlier-than-expected inventory receipts as a result of improved sourcing lead times, as well as the impact of tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/03/kontoor-brands-ktb-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"KTB 2025 Q3","e":"ktb","d":"2025-11-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Joseph A. Alkire","x":"We were very surgical as you would expect in terms of where we took price just as we have been in the past.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/03/kontoor-brands-ktb-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"KTB 2025 Q3","e":"ktb","d":"2025-11-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Joseph A. Alkire","x":"And these price increases were not just a U.S.-focused effort.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/03/kontoor-brands-ktb-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"KTB 2025 Q3","e":"ktb","d":"2025-11-03","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Scott H. Baxter","x":"Based on our year-to-date performance and improving profitability, we are raising our full-year outlook.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/03/kontoor-brands-ktb-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"KTB 2025 Q3","e":"ktb","d":"2025-11-03","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Joseph A. Alkire","x":"So for the full-year outlook, raised the outlook, right, Part of that was the Q3 outperformance that we had.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/03/kontoor-brands-ktb-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"KTB 2025 Q4","e":"ktb","d":"2026-03-03","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Joseph A. Alkire","x":"Global revenue increased 3% driven by 10% growth in DTC and 2% growth in wholesale.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/03/kontoor-brands-ktb-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"KTB 2025 Q4","e":"ktb","d":"2026-03-03","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Joseph A. Alkire","x":"In the U.S., revenue increased 3% driven by 10% growth in DTC and 3% growth in wholesale.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/03/kontoor-brands-ktb-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"KTB 2025 Q4","e":"ktb","d":"2026-03-03","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Joseph A. Alkire","x":"This was partially offset by increased product costs and the impact from increases in tariffs, net of pricing actions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/03/kontoor-brands-ktb-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"KTB 2025 Q4","e":"ktb","d":"2026-03-03","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Joseph A. Alkire","x":"Before moving to our outlook, let me provide an update on tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/03/kontoor-brands-ktb-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"KTB 2025 Q4","e":"ktb","d":"2026-03-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Joseph A. Alkire","x":"We have implemented price increases for Wrangler, Lee, and Helly Hansen as part of a holistic plan to mitigate the impact of the increases in tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/03/kontoor-brands-ktb-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"KTB 2025 Q4","e":"ktb","d":"2026-03-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Brooke Siler Roach","x":"I will pass it on.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/03/kontoor-brands-ktb-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"KTB 2025 Q4","e":"ktb","d":"2026-03-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Blake Anderson","x":"And then could you size up what are your key mitigating levers between pricing, cost savings, and sourcing to enable you to mitigate the tariffs, and what gives you confidence you can mitigate those more fully over the next 12 to 18 months as you mentioned?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/03/kontoor-brands-ktb-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"KTB 2026 Q1","e":"ktb","d":"2026-05-07","l":"streaming","r":"analyst","s":"Scott Baxter","x":"And its distribution footprint is healthy with significant white space opportunities in specialty, female and direct-to-consumer.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/06/01/kontoor-ktb-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KTB 2026 Q1","e":"ktb","d":"2026-05-07","l":"streaming","r":"analyst","s":"Scott Baxter","x":"Across both sport and workwear, we will accelerate investments in talent, direct-to-consumer and wholesale expansion and demand creation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/06/01/kontoor-ktb-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KTB 2026 Q1","e":"ktb","d":"2026-05-07","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Joseph Alkire","x":"…category mix, the planned divestiture enhances the quality of our distribution footprint and favorably shifts our portfolio towards the higher-growth DTC channel where we have the deepest connection with our consumers and are in the early innings of unlocking new data and analytics capabilities.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/06/01/kontoor-ktb-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KTB 2026 Q1","e":"ktb","d":"2026-05-07","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Joseph Alkire","x":"Global revenue increased 2%, driven by 9% growth in DTC and 2% growth in wholesale.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/06/01/kontoor-ktb-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KTB 2026 Q1","e":"ktb","d":"2026-05-07","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Joseph Alkire","x":"Moving on to tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/06/01/kontoor-ktb-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KTB 2026 Q1","e":"ktb","d":"2026-05-07","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Joseph Alkire","x":"Following the U.S. Supreme Court's decision that the Emergency Economic Powers Act does not authorize tariffs, the U.S. Court of International Trade has ordered U.S. Customs and Border Protection to refund IEPA duties.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/06/01/kontoor-ktb-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KTB 2026 Q1","e":"ktb","d":"2026-05-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Joseph Alkire","x":"The streamlining of our portfolio will free up enterprise-level resources and investment capacity to further advance our strategic initiatives and position the brand for accelerated growth in 2027 and beyond.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/06/01/kontoor-ktb-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KTB 2026 Q1","e":"ktb","d":"2026-05-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Joseph Alkire","x":"The earnings contribution of the Lee business will be offset through strong capital deployment and mitigation of overhead and other expenses that have previously been allocated to the Lee business through restructuring and other mitigating cost actions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/06/01/kontoor-ktb-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KTB 2026 Q2","e":"ktb","d":"2026-08-12","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Scott Baxter","x":"We have incredible opportunities in female, direct-to-consumer and non-denim categories, but we will not lose sight of Wrangler's identity.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/19/kontoor-brands-ktb-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KTB 2026 Q2","e":"ktb","d":"2026-08-12","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Joseph Alkire","x":"The increase in SG&A expenses was driven by the impact of a full quarter of Helly Hansen expenses compared to prior year, increased investment in direct-to-consumer demand creation and technology, partially offset by the benefits from Project Genius.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/19/kontoor-brands-ktb-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KTB 2026 Q2","e":"ktb","d":"2026-08-12","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Joseph Alkire","x":"Our strategy will be enabled by a more robust set of enterprise capabilities, including consumer insights, DTC excellence, product innovation, demand creation and technology, which along with our talented team and winning culture will be key ingredients to drive the success of our growth ambitions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/19/kontoor-brands-ktb-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KTB 2026 Q2","e":"ktb","d":"2026-08-12","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Joseph Alkire","x":"The mandate is clear: protect and build on the core business while accelerating growth in female, DTC and adjacent non-denim categories.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/19/kontoor-brands-ktb-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KTB 2026 Q2","e":"ktb","d":"2026-08-12","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Joseph Alkire","x":"Moving to tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/19/kontoor-brands-ktb-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KTB 2026 Q2","e":"ktb","d":"2026-08-12","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Joseph Alkire","x":"Following the U.S. Supreme Court's ruling that the International Emergency Economic Powers Act does not authorize tariffs, the U.S. Court of International Trade ordered U.S. Customs and Border Protection to refund IEPA duties previously paid.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/19/kontoor-brands-ktb-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KTB 2026 Q2","e":"ktb","d":"2026-08-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Joseph Alkire","x":"We expect to mitigate these costs moving forward through a combination of restructuring and other mitigating cost actions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/19/kontoor-brands-ktb-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KTB 2026 Q2","e":"ktb","d":"2026-08-12","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Joseph Alkire","x":"The fundamentals of our business are strong, and we are raising our full-year outlook based on the strength we have seen in our business year-to-date and our confidence and visibility as we enter the second half of the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/19/kontoor-brands-ktb-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KTB 2026 Q2","e":"ktb","d":"2026-08-12","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Joseph Alkire","x":"Look, based on the confidence and the visibility we have into the second half of the year really for both brands, we raised the outlook, right?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/19/kontoor-brands-ktb-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KTB 2026 Q3","e":"ktb","d":"2026-11-05","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Scott H. Baxter","x":"Turning to Wrangler, In the third quarter, growth was led by direct to consumer, female and international.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/05/kontoor-brands-ktb-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KTB 2026 Q3","e":"ktb","d":"2026-11-05","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Joseph A. Alkire","x":"Growth was led by direct to consumer, female, international and distribution expansion.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/05/kontoor-brands-ktb-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KTB 2026 Q3","e":"ktb","d":"2026-11-05","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Joseph A. Alkire","x":"U.S. revenue increased 2% driven by 7% growth in direct to consumer and 2% growth in wholesale.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/05/kontoor-brands-ktb-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KTB 2026 Q3","e":"ktb","d":"2026-11-05","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Joseph A. Alkire","x":"International revenue increased 7%, driven by 26% growth in direct to consumer and 5% growth in wholesale.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/05/kontoor-brands-ktb-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KTB 2026 Q3","e":"ktb","d":"2026-11-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Joseph A. Alkire","x":"Moving on to tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/05/kontoor-brands-ktb-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KTB 2026 Q3","e":"ktb","d":"2026-11-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Joseph A. Alkire","x":"As of the end of the third quarter, we have received essentially all IEPA tariff refunds.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/05/kontoor-brands-ktb-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KTB 2026 Q3","e":"ktb","d":"2026-11-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Joseph A. Alkire","x":"I will pass it on.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/05/kontoor-brands-ktb-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KTB 2026 Q3","e":"ktb","d":"2026-11-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Joseph A. Alkire","x":"We continue to expect to fully offset the impact of these costs over a 12- to 18-month period through mitigating cost actions including restructuring and fees expected to be received for services we will provide in support of the transition of the Lee business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/05/kontoor-brands-ktb-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KTB 202